    "Directory/lock/inode and ordinary filesystem/control allocation remain charged in the separately retained control/presentation budget; verify the whole retained filesystem, not only named serialized files.",
    "Update the owning StoragePlan projection, native independent literal adapter, Python independent storage observer and pre-effect formatted-usable admission together. The old gateway oracle remains preserved; do not infer larger usable demand merely from spare raw bytes.",
